om2
note a text with a long name handed to an unsized view parameter, and a long-named unsized parameter handed on
note (ledger L1143: front-ir did not lower an array name over 8 bytes). Stdout "selector"; status 8.
text selector_name "selector"

fn count_bytes text_bytes view uchar * to ulong
ret len text_bytes
end

fn show_and_count text_bytes view uchar * to ulong
written_bytes = write 1 text_bytes 0 len text_bytes
ret count_bytes text_bytes
end

fn main to int
ret int show_and_count selector_name
end
